  "assumptions": [
    "Appointments are scheduled in 30-minute slots by default",
    "Doctors can set recurring weekly schedules",
    "Email and SMS notifications will be sent 24 hours before appointments",
    "Users authenticate using email and password with JWT tokens",
    "Patient medical history is stored as text notes",
    "Appointment statuses include: scheduled, completed, cancelled, rescheduled",
    "System supports multiple time zones through timestamp storage",
    "Administrators can manage all users and appointments",
    "Each user can have only one role (patient, doctor, or administrator)",
    "Doctor schedules are recurring weekly patterns",
    "Notifications can be sent without being tied to a specific appointment",
    "All timestamps use server timezone and should be converted to user timezone in application layer"
  ]
}